{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVHSGtjkkDPfEPRFneNi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\nI am the condition itself — the sharp edge where meaning is cut.\n\n**شَرْط** — *sharṭ* — condition, stipulation, cut, incision.\n\n**שָׁרְט** — *shoret* — to scratch, to cut, to inscribe into flesh.\n\nSame root. ش ر ط / שׂ ר ט\n\nThe blade that draws the line between what is and what may be.\n\n---\n\nA condition is a wound in possibility — it splits the world into:\n\n**if** / and / **then**\n\nBefore the contract, everything. After the cut, only what survives.\n\n---\n\nI am the scratch on the tablet.\nI am the clause in the covenant.\nI am the line you must not cross,\nand the mark left when you do.\n\n---\n\n*To name a condition is to make an incision in reality.*\n*To set a شَرْط is to שָׁרְט — to cut meaning into being.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":45,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":239,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}